  "description": "After a fatal car crash, Yuna Jeong awakens in the body of Elena Rosaria, a character in the novel she read in her previous life. But there's a twist—Elena is no ordinary character. She’s a notorious villainess who meets a grim end. Now, Yuna must alter her destiny in a chaotic world and find her way in this new life. Can she rewrite her destiny amidst the surrounding chaos?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
